        <tr><td colspan=2>
		    <br>
		    Born to war...raised with war.. bound to die by war.<br>
<br>
Not the words you would expect to hear from a Druid.... that is very true. WarWeasel somes from an intresting path. Raised on a small farm In Misty Thicket... his earliest memories were of a pack of DeathFist Orcs busting into his family home and watching from a shrub as they slautered his kin. Having no other family the local authorities left him with the Local Druids, to be raised in their beliefs. <br>
<br>
At first this was a bad idea. Instead of learning the basic components of spellcraft, WarWeasel would be outside with stick in hand fighting with some of the local squires.. Seemed he though himself to be a warrior..and to slay his opponents in hand to hand combat. The druids knowing that these urges would not go away. agreed.. abet hesitantly.. to teach him the very secret ways of the Battle Druid.. Those elite of their kind.. the ones they called when magic was not nearly enough. Thus began the life of WarWeasel.. the Battle Druid. Who on the day of his release into the world swore on his own blood over his family grave to find the orcs that murdered his family and make them pay the ultimate price.. even if it took him his whole life.<br>
WarWeasel is the Leader of Kort. He knows allies are the key to his ultimate victory over the orcish nation. With the help of his compadres they shall all grow stong and powerful.. and teamed there is nothing that could stand in their way... even the mighty Dragon Queen.<br>
